WEBVTT

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:08.980
Emergency message 1505.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:12.190
An observation plane has vanished 75 
nautical miles off Isla's southern tip.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:14.020
<i>Attention, observer squads.</i>

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:17.740
<i>You are to take off at once, and begin 
operations in the designated area.</i>

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:24.350
<i>Repeat: You are to take off at once, 
and begin operations in the designated area.</i>

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:21.520
Everyone, try not to do anything stupid,

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.030
and keep the observer plane's 
sacrifice from being in vain.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:28.250
Benji, if it hurts, switch with someone.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.350
It's no problem.

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:32.760
I can handle the cameras.

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:36.140
Take care of him, Sharon.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:37.890
Right.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:41.430
This is our last mission for Isla.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.320
Let's make sure we don't lose anyone!

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:44.360
Yeah!

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:50.610
They look like real pilots now.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:51.730
Yes.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.990
Over the past six months, 
Kal-el Albus particularly has matured.

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:59.990
Well, with everything that's happened...

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:08.620
Electrical systems, hydrogen battery 
stack, oil, and trim all okay.

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:10.280
Kal, sorry I'm late!

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:09.890
Altitude adjustment—

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:15.080
You're going to fly like that?

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:16.180
Shut up.

00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:19.640
Last night, I tuned up all four planes,

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:21.670
so don't worry, everyone!

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:28.860
<i>I'm going, Mother...</i>

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:30.640
<i>Michael...</i>

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:34.650
<i>Claire.</i>

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:45.300
Kal this is...

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:49.710
The End of the Sky!

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:27.780
<i>After that battle,</i>

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:32.040
<b>Episode 12: 
The End of the Sky</b>

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:30.270
<i>we temporarily succeeded in driving off the Sky Clan.</i>

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:34.440
I'm honored to meet you, Governor Nina Viento.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:38.680
I am Marcos Guerrero, commander of 
the Holy Levamme Empire's fleet

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:42.200
for the exploration of the Holy Spring theater.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.240
We can understand each other's language.

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:51.130
On behalf of Isla, I welcome you.

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:54.080
We are very grateful for your assistance.

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:03.460
Governor Nina Viento, I would love if you 
could visit the Holy Levamme Empire,

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:07.360
and speak with High Consul Fana Levamme.

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:09.470
Is she...

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:13.690
She is known as the Holy Mother of the 
Western Seas, our nation's empress.

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:17.190
She gives off a feeling very similar to yours.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.990
Young, intelligent, and beautiful...

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:23.820
And rather stubborn, as well.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:31.900
What?

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:33.210
Hey!

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.550
I see...

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:44.440
The Saint Aldista's seed, is it?

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:47.510
In this world,

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:50.110
some countries are separated, like isolated islands,

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:52.990
but they share the same myths and roots.

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:56.150
Like Levamme or your homeland,

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:58.770
or the Sky Clan.

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:02.930
But you cannot negotiate with the Sky Clan.

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:06.530
Thanks to their continued opposition,

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:09.160
we can't even cross over the Holy Spring,

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:11.790
let alone get close to the End of the Sky.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:16.170
Then Isla is in grave danger?

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:19.170
If we keep fighting,

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:23.380
we will exhaust our resources, 
and end up buried in the Holy Spring.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:29.050
Excuse me.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.430
What is it?

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:34.060
An unidentified plane flew overhead, 
leaving this message.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.260
This is surprising.

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:44.530
The Sky Clan has offered a truce.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:48.350
But they desire something in exchange.

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:49.910
Something in exchange?

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:50.620
What is it?

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:58.330
Both of them will survive.

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:00.710
And they'll wake up soon.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:06.390
Now the teachers are the only problem.

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:09.870
I heard they'll be punished for disobeying orders.

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:11.730
We'll be just fine.

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:13.020
Don't worry about us.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:16.020
We aren't so far gone that we need 
you students to worry over us.

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:18.770
How did you get here?

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:21.160
A certain someone got us out here.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:23.330
A certain someone?

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:26.780
"Pervert weird-beard" is a better name for him.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:35.390
The Council of Four has entered into 
discussions with the Sky Clan.

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:37.910
Most likely, there won't be any more battles.

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:41.010
Then will Isla...

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:42.920
...get through the Holy Spring safely?

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:47.340
All right!

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:53.580
But in return, they're requesting one thing.

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:58.560
They want Nina Viento, AKA Claire Cruz.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:10.660
Be quick, but be careful.

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:16.290
Thank you for everything.

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:20.500
You did well, to last until the end.

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:27.060
If we believe what the Sky Clan's message says...

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:28.870
In their creation myth,

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:32.840
someone called the "Girl Who Calls 
the Wind" is prophesied to arrive.

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:39.040
The "Girl Who Calls the Wind," 
Saint Aldista's daughter,

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:42.850
will arrive on a floating island 
from beyond the waterfall,

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:46.730
and lead the Sky Clan to new prosperity.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:51.770
So to them, this is a legendary messiah's arrival.

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:52.580
Yes.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:56.740
They want her so much,

00:07:56.740 --> 00:08:01.330
they're willing to bend their policy of killing 
any who enters the Holy Spring.

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:04.450
Nina... No, Claire Cruz...

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:07.960
I'm the one who brought you to Isla.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.960
I can't just let—

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:11.800
I'm grateful to you, Admiral.

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:17.050
By coming to Isla, I've gained something wonderful.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:23.140
But if I do not go to the Sky Clan, Isla will...

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:29.400
I don't want to lose anything else.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:34.700
Allow me to do my duty.

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:36.740
Claire...

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.290
I can't believe it...

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:44.290
Claire is Nina Viento?

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:48.780
But now that you mention it, 
it does kind of make sense.

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:52.960
I was hiding who I really was...

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:55.380
In a way, I guess we're similar.

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:04.250
What will you do, Kal-el Albus?

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:07.480
Well?

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.900
What will you do, Kal?

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:16.780
I don't know.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:20.480
But I want to meet her, and talk to her.

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:23.300
I understand what's happening,

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:26.540
but it hurts too much to accept.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:29.540
It means we're sacrificing Claire!

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.150
I won't let that happen.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:34.670
I...

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:37.300
You like Claire? As a girl?

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.500
Wh-What are you saying all the sudden?

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:43.420
It's okay... Just say it.

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:51.020
I do.

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:01.030
I see.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:04.320
What... That's it?

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:06.040
I gave you a serious answer.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.550
Ari, that's dangerous...

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:09.930
You'll fall.

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:12.310
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:26.460
All right.

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:28.020
Let's go see Claire.

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:30.620
But how?

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:34.120
Don't worry, I have an idea.

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.880
Then it's decided.

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:38.650
Goodnight.

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:42.840
A-Ari!

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:46.850
Kal!

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:48.620
What?

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:55.390
Dummy!

00:10:57.930 --> 00:10:59.880
What's with her?

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:12.760
So how do we get in?

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:15.670
You said you had an idea, right?

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:16.470
Yeah.

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:18.880
Excuse me.

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:19.490
Hey!

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:25.810
We're friends of Claire. Could we see her?

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:26.960
Who are you?

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:28.220
A-Ari!

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:30.140
Hey, Claire!

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:31.250
Hey, stop it.

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:33.230
Let them through.

00:11:33.740 --> 00:11:35.100
What are you saying?

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:39.150
It's Governor Nina Viento's final request.

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:40.170
Let them through.

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:42.440
Ignacio, you...

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:44.040
Nice timing!

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:46.100
I was hoping you'd show up.

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:50.310
There are thirty minutes until she leaves.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.990
This is your last chance.

00:11:58.680 --> 00:11:59.570
Come in.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:04.680
Claire!

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:08.330
Thank you for coming, both of you.

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.000
Claire...

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:23.150
You've decided, then...

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:31.100
This is from everyone in the dorm.

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:33.850
They're all grateful to you.

00:12:35.510 --> 00:12:38.190
But I don't want to say goodbye.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:42.000
Because if I do, it will feel like 
I'll never see you again.

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:46.110
So I came to say, "See you again."

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.170
Ari...

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:53.140
This isn't goodbye.

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.590
We'll see each other again.

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:56.900
We will see each other again!

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:03.280
I'm happy that I made friends...

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.710
I never thought I could.

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:07.720
But thanks to you...

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.100
Claire...

00:13:20.890 --> 00:13:21.690
Ari...

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:24.410
See you again, Claire.

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:29.120
I'm glad I met you, too!

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:37.820
Claire...

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:41.090
Kal-el...

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:45.970
I don't want to let you go!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:49.330
Now that we finally know how we feel, 
I don't want to say goodbye.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:52.890
Let's run away, Claire.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.100
I know...

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:58.150
We can go to the runaway, 
and hijack a La Guardia.

00:13:58.150 --> 00:13:58.900
Kal...

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:01.710
It'll be fine... I'll make sure of it.

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:03.570
I won't lose to the Sky Clan!

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:06.640
If we can get from the Holy Spring to the sea,

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:09.080
we can find an island with no one on it...

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:12.130
We can reach the End of the Sky together.

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:14.330
I'll stay with you forever!

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:22.340
Thank you, Kal.

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:24.960
I'm really happy you feel that way.

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:31.290
But I'm not going just to be a sacrifice.

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:34.470
I'm going so I can fight my battle.

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:40.070
Like Ari and everyone... 
Like you taught me, Kal.

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:42.190
Claire...

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:46.210
A good luck charm.

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:49.150
Just look at it, and think of me.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:52.010
I won't say goodbye.

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:53.280
Like Ari said...

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:56.500
We'll see each other again!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.290
Claire...

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:21.940
Claire!

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:29.820
Claire...

00:15:36.610 --> 00:15:38.610
Claire!

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:42.750
Claire!

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:48.620
Claire!

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:49.340
Kal!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:51.180
What's going on?

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:52.720
That boy...

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:57.350
Claire...

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:58.970
I'll find the End of the Sky,

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:01.140
and we'll all make it back safely...

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.110
And once this journey ends,

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:05.770
I'll come back here!

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:08.160
I don't know how many years it will take,

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:12.070
but I'll come back to get you!

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:17.490
I'll do my best, too!

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:26.750
Kal!

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:30.280
Ari...

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:33.220
This is goodbye.

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:37.220
Twenty guards will be accompanying Claire.

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:41.470
I've protected Claire since I was a child.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.580
I'll merely be doing it there, too.

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:46.440
Igna...

00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:49.610
Don't forget the promise you just made.

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:52.570
No, of course not.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.360
I will not allow anyone to lay a finger on Claire.

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:00.790
I promise you that.

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:04.790
You're such a tsundere, Igna.

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:10.800
Make sure you return, stupid older brother.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.980
No matter how many years it 
takes, you'd better return!

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:20.130
He just called me "older brother."

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:23.100
No way... You're imagining it.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:37.430
I'll be glad to be rid of your ugly faces...

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:42.990
Ignacio Axis, why are you smiling?

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:45.520
No reason.

00:18:09.570 --> 00:18:11.960
<i>Isla continued its journey...</i>

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:15.910
<i>Through the Holy Spring, 
and across the great sea.</i>

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:21.220
<i>Since then, it's been six months.</i>

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:23.830
<i>And we've made it this far at last.</i>

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:26.590
<i>And finally, today...</i>

00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:28.750
Wow... The sky...

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:30.960
This is...

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:32.950
The End of the Sky!

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:40.340
Everyone's already evacuated, right?

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:41.620
Yeah.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:45.850
By now, they should all be aboard 
the Levamme escort fleet.

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:47.600
Bring us to a stop.

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:51.230
Any closer, and we'll be caught up in that, too.

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:00.790
A rainbow of light...

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:04.280
Just like the legend of Saint Aldista says.

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:05.540
Impossible...

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:08.210
The legends weren't just stories.

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:13.060
They told us how our world really is?

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:20.130
The flagstone created the Holy 
Spring and the End of the Sky.

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:24.230
Part of the flagstone flew up 
from within the Holy Spring,

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:26.640
and it became an island that floated in the sky.

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:33.230
The flying island slowly passed 
above human heads,

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:35.320
across three seas,

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:41.320
and eventually returned to the 
rainbow at the End of the Sky.

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:50.580
Here we go, Kal!

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:51.950
Yeah!

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:53.670
Let's celebrate!

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:08.730
Can you see it, Mitty?

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:12.100
I'm a real pilot now...

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:14.660
I made it to the End of the Sky.

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:17.270
Wolf...

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:18.730
Everyone.

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:23.740
Yeah, we're all together.

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:27.240
Let's do a victory dance.

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:43.510
Look, Kal!

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:45.640
Isla is...

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:47.850
...disappearing.

00:20:56.210 --> 00:20:58.540
No... No!

00:20:58.540 --> 00:20:59.900
Don't cry, Nanako!

00:21:00.850 --> 00:21:02.510
Watch...

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:04.030
Make sure you don't forget it.

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:10.600
Goodbye!

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:12.290
Goodbye, Isla!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:13.990
Thank you!

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:15.620
Thank you!

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:23.240
Thank you, Isla!

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:25.720
Thank you!

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:28.550
Thank you!

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:29.970
Farewell.

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:31.420
Thank you.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.890
Thank you!

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:51.150
It's gone...

00:21:52.020 --> 00:21:53.020
Yeah.

00:23:31.590 --> 00:23:33.090
It's me, Ignacio.

00:23:33.090 --> 00:23:35.100
I guess he made it back.

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:37.890
He was saying how he'd come get Claire...

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:41.100
<b>Episode 13 
The Sky Where You Are</b>

00:23:38.610 --> 00:23:41.100
